{
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0r.char": "扭曲的源头，我来修正你了",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-1r.ancient": "我就是正确，我就是正义，你们这群无理之人",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-attack": "我将修正一切",
  "NEOW.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0.ancient": "苏醒吧，远方的灵魂......",
  "NEOW.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.ancient": "苏醒吧，远方的灵魂......",
  "NEOW.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.char": "这是回溯了吗，又感受到了，塔顶的扭曲......",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0.ancient": "随便挑！只要你懂它们的价值！",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.ancient": "随便挑！只要你懂它们的价值！",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.char": "这些东西，我不需要",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.next": "一意追寻正确吗，那去找建筑师吧，我的藏品永远在这等你——！",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0.ancient": "你！你！爬的好高！！亮晶晶的正义！！给你！变强！",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.ancient": "你！你！爬的好高！！亮晶晶的正义！！给你！变强！",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.char": "力量不该这样轻易给予......你的意图是什么？",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.ancient": "孤独......想看光！想看赢！想着坏人碎掉！！拿着！去战斗！我在这里看！",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-3.char": "......我明白了，我会用它守护正义，不是为了你",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0.ancient": "拿走吧......我的一部分......让你平静......",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.ancient": "拿走吧......我的一部分......让你平静......",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.char": "你的力量......来自牺牲自己？",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.ancient": "高塔......太吵了......你们去战斗......去平息建筑师那扭曲的正确",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-3.char": "我收下这份力量，我会去纠正建筑师，如同纠正过去的自己",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-3.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-4.ancient": "别吵醒我......zZZzz......",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0.ancient": "正义的旅人......力量需要代价",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.ancient": "正义的旅人......力量需要代价",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.char": "我愿承担代价，为我那无罪的理想",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.ancient": "很好，火焰与你同在......别让它......吞噬你......",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-3.char": "我会掌控它，用这燃烧的正义，照亮塔顶",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0.ancient": "旅人，你渴望美丽与幸运吗？拿走我的馈赠，让高塔为你闪耀",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.ancient": "旅人，你渴望美丽与幸运吗？拿走我的馈赠，让高塔为你闪耀",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.char": "我愿以力量换安宁，终结这里的混乱",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.ancient": "很好，愿你的旅途繁花似锦，卡牌皆成至宝，去吧，为了你心灵中的美",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0.ancient": "弱者！来与我一战！赢了，就赐你力量！",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.ancient": "弱者！来与我一战！赢了，就赐你力量！",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.char": "这是不正确的，我的敌人是塔顶的扭曲",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.ancient": "哈哈！有趣！强大的弱者，用我的力量，纠正一切！",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.0-0.ancient": "强大的信念，去杀死那可恶的建筑师吧！！",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.ancient": "强大的信念，去杀死那可恶的建筑师吧！！",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-0.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.char": "不正确！邪恶！待我纠正塔顶的不正确，就来焚烧你个恶魔！",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.ancient": "好好好！真是妄想，那就看你那可笑的正义，能走到何步！",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-2.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_HIRO.1-3.char": "[i][b](希罗皱眉，握紧长剑）令人作呕[/b][/i]",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.title": "岛之魔女",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.epithet": "被遗忘的守护者",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.pages.INITIAL.description": "在探索的途中，你们遇到了名为岛之魔女的古老存在。",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.firstVisitEver.0-0.ancient": "[jitter][b]有谁......能听见我的声音吗......[/b][/jitter]",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.0-0r.ancient": "[jitter][b]有谁......能听见我的声音吗......[/b][/jitter]",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.1-0r.ancient": "[jitter][b]有谁......能听见我的声音吗......[/b][/jitter]",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.1-0r.next": "倾听",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.1-1r.char": "[i]（虽然很微弱，但确实有声音）[/i]",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.1-2r.ancient": "我只希望[color=#cccccc]【她】[/color]......能在和人类共存中，找到属于自己的[b]【幸福】[/b]",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.1-3r.ancient": "我想请你向[color=#cccccc]【她】[/color]传达......[color=#cccccc]【她】[/color]不必再背负所谓[jitter][b]【生为魔女的命运】[/b][/jitter]了",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.1-3r.next": "继续",
  "MANOSABA_LIN_EVENT_WITCHOFTHE_ISLAND.talk.ANY.1-4r.ancient": "[b][sine]拜托了,请你[/sine][/b][jitter]救救[color=#cccccc]【她】[/color][/jitter][b][sine]吧[/sine][/b]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0r.char": "你在，把自己关起来吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-1r.ancient": "啊……你身上有很特殊的气息。不是尖塔的造物，也不是普通的凡人。那种……被诅咒的力量",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-attack": "我将修正一切",
  "NEOW.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0.ancient": "踏入此地，便再无法回头",
  "NEOW.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.ancient": "踏入此地，便再无法回头",
  "NEOW.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.char": "就算前路很难，我也不会退缩不前",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0.ancient": "新来的小家伙!来看我的收藏吗?!",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.ancient": "新来的小家伙!来看我的收藏吗?!",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.char": "只是路过，我并没有可以拿来交换的东西哦",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.next": "没事，挑吧！以后常来！",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0.ancient": "找到了找到了！！这个不好看……这个亮闪闪！！但是不对！！欧洛巴斯要找的是——",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.ancient": "找到了找到了！！这个不好看……这个亮闪闪！！但是不对！！欧洛巴斯要找的是——",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.char": "那个，你好。我是路过的。这里……是你的家吗？",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.ancient": "给你给你——拿上这些！！带上亮闪闪！！心里就会暖一点！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-3.char": "比我厉害的人有很多。真正帮得上忙的人......谢谢你",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0.ancient": "……有新的客人来了。不用担心，这些熔化的部分不会烫到你。坐吧",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.ancient": "……有新的客人来了。不用担心，这些熔化的部分不会烫到你。坐吧",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.char": "……你不觉得我很奇怪吗？一个人跑到塔里，什么都不会，还总是给别人添麻烦",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.ancient": "我一直在熔化。每天。每时每刻。别人以为我在消逝——但其实我在再生。旧的流走了，新的会长出来。痛是有的，但这不是坏事",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-3.char": "……我会再来的。不是为了你的一部分",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-3.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-4.ancient": "学习我吧，找到一些平静",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0.ancient": "你们人类都一样。带着缺点进来，带着决心离开——然后又带着新的缺点回来，欢迎回来",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.ancient": "你们人类都一样。带着缺点进来，带着决心离开——然后又带着新的缺点回来，欢迎回来",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.char": "……我还能被原谅吗？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.ancient": "先原谅自己。烧掉缺点的人，有资格从头开始",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-3.char": "谢谢，轻了一点点，但走得比以前稳了",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0.ancient": "哎呀，你的穿搭看起来有些乏味呢，来，我给你挑些漂亮的穿吧",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.ancient": "哎呀，你的穿搭看起来有些乏味呢，来，我给你挑些漂亮的穿吧",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.char": "……乏味吗？这已经是我最正式的服装了",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.ancient": "一个高贵的访客，该有高贵的赐福。小姑娘，力量不在于你曾经做了什么，而在于你现在想做什么。穿上我的力量，去消灭塔顶的疯狂吧",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0.ancient": "太弱小了！连握紧武器的力气都没有吗？！",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.ancient": "太弱小了！连握紧武器的力气都没有吗？！",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.char": "……那个，你好。我叫樱羽艾玛。我确实……不太会用武器",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.ancient": "你不挥剑，却已经在审判别人！嘴也是强大的武器！！暗红的那个也不愿意和我打，你也不愿意！但你们都很有趣！",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.0-0.ancient": "啊——樱羽艾玛。终于来了。我等了你好久好久。把你自己交给我，你就能变得和我一样万众畏惧！",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.ancient": "啊——樱羽艾玛。终于来了。我等了你好久好久。把你自己交给我，你就能变得和我一样万众畏惧！",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-0.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.char": "我不会签的。被原谅不是交易来的。你这种人永远不会懂——因为你不觉得任何事需要被原谅",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.ancient": "太弱小了。连握紧武器的力气都没有的小女孩，想威胁恶魔？！",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-2.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.MANOSABA_LIN_CHARACTER_EMALIN.1-3.char": "你不是在帮他们。你是在把他们变成傀儡。变成更多和你一样的人。我不需要这种帮助"
}
